1. Set `REDUCTO_API_KEY`.
2. Choose one interface:
* Local file or folder: use the [Reducto CLI](https://docs.reducto.ai/cli.md).
* Agent tool calling: use the [Reducto MCP server](https://docs.reducto.ai/mcp-server.md).
* Application code: use the Python, Node.js, Go, or cURL examples below.
3. Parse the sample PDF first, then replace the URL or file path with your document.
```bash CLI theme={null}
pip install reducto-cli
reducto login
curl -L -o fidelity-example.pdf https://cdn.reducto.ai/samples/fidelity-example.pdf
reducto parse ./fidelity-example.pdf
```
```python Python theme={null}
from reducto import Reducto
client = Reducto()
result = client.parse.run(input="https://cdn.reducto.ai/samples/fidelity-example.pdf")
print(result.job_id)
print(result.result.chunks[0].content[:1000])
```
```javascript Node.js theme={null}
import Reducto from "reductoai";
const client = new Reducto();
const result = await client.parse.run({
input: "https://cdn.reducto.ai/samples/fidelity-example.pdf",
});
console.log(result.job_id);
console.log(result.result.chunks[0].content.slice(0, 1000));
```
